  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">Meirghul was the closest of the Ana’zhak to the darksea, and you willingly plunge yourself into the abyssal depths to open yourself to its influences in hopes of becoming a Deep Serpent.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> You gain darkvision, and suffer no penalty or environmental damage for swimming in deep oceans (such as through pressure or cold) and are able to see clearly through it. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your saves and DCs against creatures or effects with the Nightmare trait.</span></p>"
